# --- RSA KEY FINGERPRINTS ---
# gramsrv fingerprint is used by default, change in production!
# Fingerprint modulus can be obtained in RSA keys folder using openssl:
# ```
# cd /opt/gramsrv/data/
# openssl rsa -pubin -in server_rsa.pub -modulus -noout
# ```
# Copy the value after "Modulus="
